m/apps/2468100/extras/f59a5f9cbb3fc6e8237160e536488851.poster.avif?t=1752528241\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468100/extras/f59a5f9cbb3fc6e8237160e536488851.webm?t=1752528241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468100/extras/f59a5f9cbb3fc6e8237160e536488851.mp4?t=1752528241\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Upgrade your deck</strong> by unlocking over 200 powerful relics and 100+ cards that you can switch on-the-fly to maximize your deck in between enemy encounters.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468100/extras/4af5a5250842fc504d141981c1c8fa01.poster.avif?t=1752528241\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468100/extras/4af5a5250842fc504d141981c1c8fa01.webm?t=1752528241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468100/extras/4af5a5250842fc504d141981c1c8fa01.mp4?t=1752528241\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Fight through distinct biomes</strong> such as dark caverns, corrupted swamps, menacing mountains, each with their own set of creatures and terrain modifiers.<br>Between expeditions, return to your village and restore buildings to <strong>unlock upgrades for your items and spells</strong>.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468100/extras/45e77998fd1f624c6eea252ae106d936.poster.avif?t=1752528241\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468100/extras/45e77998fd1f624c6eea252ae106d936.webm?t=1752528241\" type=\"vid